+ *cause he is my cousin,* where *the* anticipates *because* &c.;
>>>

<<<
Though he is my cousin I am not the more likely to agree with him, where the refers back to though &c.;
===
*Though he is my cousin I am not the more likely to agree with him,* where *the* refers back to *though* &c.;
>>>

<<<
As the hour approached I grew the more nervous, where the means by so much & refers back to as &c.
===
*As the hour approached I grew the more nervous,* where *the* means *by so much* & refers back to *as* &c.
>>>

<<<
recalled by the, & moreover it will probably be admitted at once that removal of the does not weaken
===
recalled by *the*, & moreover it will probably be admitted at once that removal of *the* does not weaken
>>>

<<<
but in each the has been gratuitously inserted,
===
but in each *the* has been gratuitously inserted,
